 "summary": "A single N-channel enhancement MOSFET for small-signal switching up to 50 V and 0.22 A, in the three-lead SOT-323. On-resistance is at most 3.5 Ω with 10 V of gate drive and 6.0 Ω with 4.5 V; the gate threshold lies between 0.7 and 1.5 V. Uses named for it are battery-powered equipment, solid-state relays and direct TTL/CMOS logic-level interfacing.",
